<title>UK: Merrill Lynch and Gottardo set UBS calls.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch and Gottardo set UBS calls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets and Banca del Gottardo has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Union Bank of Switzerland bearer shares.</p>
<p> One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1400 CHF		  PREMIUM	13.20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.95 CHF		  GEARING	16.90 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.MAR.97-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1305 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
